			"notes": "Minecraft 26.3 for Fabric and NeoForge.\n\nThe Chipped mason table recipes are now gated on Chipped being installed. Without that gate, Minecraft 26.3 aborts the whole registry load on the unknown recipe serializer, so any world without Chipped failed to load.\n\nConnected textures come from CTM Reborn, which is listed as a dependency. It is a fork of Athena kept on current versions until Athena updates."
